          <declname>worker_settings</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Create a Worker. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>The encapsulates the functions of the Acquisiton Context, Processing Context, Exporter, and Viewer into a single container and manages the communications between these. It also enables multi-threaded operation <simplesect kind="note"><para>The set functions need to be called in order for the worker to be enabled.</para>
</simplesect>
